en.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1799012/vuurzee.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1799012/vuurzee.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"e2b6cd9e2aa8cbfdf3081cbfc4c7fa6fbe927e30e21a028a67951432df5034f1"}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021485812","key":{"id":976200133},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":924100772,"title":"King of wrath","isbn_13":"9789021485812","isbn_10":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen","open_library_edition_id":null,"id":976200133}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021485812","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021485812"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021485812","work_id":924100772,"bound_author_id":924300405,"bound_title":"King of wrath","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789021485812","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000617725_King_of_wrath_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1771828/king-of-wrath.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1771828/king-of-wrath.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","sha256":"3194665154369fc6650868153acaf6aacb17fff9e2e8a29bd52b17a1c1090fc0","fact":"Exact title/author/ISBN, physical format and language source reviewed; independent contradictions recorded"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000617725_King_of_wrath_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T10:57:20.744Z","sha256":"4af00e2f2a1beb7cd8f0da45c7ce38f40db6c1a2785d84b280c208b47731a0c1","bytes":395205,"fact":"Same-edition source association and title/author artwork visually reviewed; not only HTTP200"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:772","key":{"work_id":924100772,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":924100772,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300405,"text":"Dante Russo heeft zijn leven en zakelijke positie zorgvuldig opgebouwd. Een gedwongen verloving met Vivian Lau doorkruist zijn plannen. Hij ziet haar aanvankelijk vooral als onderdeel van een afspraak waaraan hij wil ontsnappen, terwijl Vivian probeert om te gaan met de verwachtingen van haar familie. Naarmate ze elkaar beter leren kennen, wordt hun verhouding minder eenvoudig. Persoonlijke gevoelens komen tegenover loyaliteit, reputatie en de oorspronkelijke redenen voor hun verbintenis te staan.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1771828/king-of-wrath.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1771828/king-of-wrath.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"3194665154369fc6650868153acaf6aacb17fff9e2e8a29bd52b17a1c1090fc0"}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789400517806","key":{"id":976200134},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":91021005,"title":"Cruise","isbn_13":"9789400517806","isbn_10":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Bruna Uitgevers B.V., A.W.","open_library_edition_id":null,"id":976200134}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789400517806","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789400517806"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789400517806","work_id":91021005,"bound_author_id":91021002,"bound_title":"Cruise","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789400517806","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000633443_Cruise_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/256681/cruise.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/256681/cruise.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","sha256":"b62a6faf2a64f546cdc767600f0289f5d8ecec04d48ba2a0d3f1103e09971532","fact":"Exact title/author/ISBN, physical format and language source reviewed; independent contradictions recorded"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000633443_Cruise_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T10:57:22.556Z","sha256":"0f51d274a7413e65fb6fae76aa10131e7097cd344047dd1498ccdca9a2de7373","bytes":442046,"fact":"Same-edition source association and title/author artwork visually reviewed; not only HTTP200"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1223","key":{"work_id":91021005,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":91021005,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":91021002,"text":"Heleen krijgt voor haar vijftiende huwelijksjaar een cruise cadeau van Frank. De gezamenlijke vakantie eindigt echter met zijn verdwijning, waarna zij alleen naar Nederland terugkeert. Terwijl ze probeert met het verlies om te gaan, neemt een kredietverstrekker contact met haar op. Daardoor ontdekt ze dat Frank belangrijke zaken verborgen hield. De vragen rond zijn verdwijning veranderen zo ook haar beeld van hun huwelijk en van het leven dat zij samen leidden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/256681/cruise.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/256681/cruise.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"b62a6fa